1
00:00:34,604 --> 00:00:36,664
Thunder rips across the sky

2
00:00:36,834 --> 00:00:38,724
Darkness surges like a flood

3
00:00:39,374 --> 00:00:41,264
The earth trembles beneath our feet

4
00:00:41,444 --> 00:00:44,944
The world's gaze leaves nowhere to hide

5
00:00:45,264 --> 00:00:47,404
An unprecedented battlefield

6
00:00:47,724 --> 00:00:49,483
Stretches beyond the borders

7
00:00:49,484 --> 00:00:51,484
Cries echo from the distance

8
00:00:51,584 --> 00:00:55,203
Like the knell of fate's judgment

9
00:00:55,204 --> 00:00:59,324
No one can change me

10
00:01:00,374 --> 00:01:04,004
No one can take me away

11
00:01:04,224 --> 00:01:06,184
I will survive

12
00:01:09,254 --> 00:01:11,284
I will survive

13
00:01:12,874 --> 00:01:15,524
Starlight endures amid the ashes

14
00:01:15,844 --> 00:01:17,904
Twinkle, twinkle, shining bright

15
00:01:18,194 --> 00:01:23,864
Burning fury that never dies

16
00:01:34,344 --> 00:01:38,224
Flames blaze,

17
00:01:39,394 --> 00:01:44,024
only faith

18
00:01:44,434 --> 00:01:52,634
illuminates the eternal night.

19
00:02:11,770 --> 00:02:12,270
Tianluo Shi,

20
00:02:12,770 --> 00:02:13,310
take a look at this.

21
00:02:14,310 --> 00:02:15,560
Satellite imagery from a month ago.

22
00:02:19,230 --> 00:02:20,230
What's going on here?

23
00:02:21,020 --> 00:02:22,020
Any other clues?

24
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:23,390
None.

25
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,480
For the past six months,

26
00:02:25,980 --> 00:02:27,640
no ships have approached this island.

27
00:02:28,900 --> 00:02:30,460
Yet the island's withered state...

28
00:02:31,470 --> 00:02:33,650
...likely points to the rise of a new Class A.

29
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:35,730
Let's hope this person

30
00:02:36,350 --> 00:02:37,480
hasn't gone to Koh Chang.

31
00:02:43,930 --> 00:02:45,510
Weak. So weak.

32
00:02:50,490 --> 00:02:51,430
Whether Rogue Cultivators,

33
00:02:51,540 --> 00:02:52,640
the Covenant,

34
00:02:53,140 --> 00:02:54,600
or Air Boy—

35
00:02:55,340 --> 00:02:57,930
all of you are far too weak.

36
00:02:58,850 --> 00:02:59,390
Seriously,

37
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:00,910
you're a complete rabble.

38
00:03:01,350 --> 00:03:01,890
Howard,

39
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:03,980
you don't speak for the Phoenix Society.

40
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:05,680
Mind the Saints' position.

41
00:03:08,270 --> 00:03:09,520
No need to sow discord.

42
00:03:10,100 --> 00:03:11,310
I'm just stating facts.

43
00:03:13,060 --> 00:03:14,270
I really don't get it.

44
00:03:15,060 --> 00:03:16,230
Guys like you,

45
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:18,980
fleeing at the sight of creatures of the ruins—

46
00:03:20,390 --> 00:03:21,770
where do you get the nerve

47
00:03:22,230 --> 00:03:23,890
to explore the ruins at all?

48
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:28,230
Maybe to ordinary people,

49
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,410
you're heroes,

50
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,330
the strong ones.

51
00:03:31,060 --> 00:03:32,060
But inside these ruins,

52
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:34,060
you're absolute trash.

53
00:03:35,250 --> 00:03:35,559
Why, you...!

54
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,020
You up front, run!

55
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,709
You up front, run!

56
00:03:39,710 --> 00:03:40,099
What?
You up front, run!

57
00:03:40,100 --> 00:03:40,330
What?

58
00:03:40,430 --> 00:03:42,850
Run now or it's too late!

59
00:03:47,270 --> 00:03:48,640
Phoenix Society, follow me!

60
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:54,930
Didn't someone just say fleeing danger

61
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:57,100
means you shouldn't come to the ruins?

62
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:59,180
Aren't you running faster than anyone?

63
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:03,389
Losing face is nothing.

64
00:04:03,390 --> 00:04:04,639
Losing my life would be a total waste!

65
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:05,640
I'm not an idiot!

66
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:07,349
Good God...

67
00:04:07,350 --> 00:04:08,349
Why is everyone in the Heavenly Net

68
00:04:08,350 --> 00:04:09,810
such a massive troublemaker?!

69
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:11,100
Bro,

70
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:12,850
where'd you get such massive backup?

71
00:04:14,270 --> 00:04:15,099
That sheer number,

72
00:04:15,100 --> 00:04:15,809
that efficiency...

73
00:04:15,810 --> 00:04:17,230
That's insane!

74
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:21,110
His first reaction is being envious?!

75
00:04:21,630 --> 00:04:22,460
Heavenly Net!

76
00:04:22,790 --> 00:04:24,550
Did you come abroad just to disgust the world?!

77
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,440
I have to go back and help the old man fight!

78
00:04:29,270 --> 00:04:30,600
He ran into a Class A creature!

79
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:32,050
What did you—

80
00:04:32,810 --> 00:04:34,270
You and the other groups split the gargoyles!

81
00:04:34,490 --> 00:04:35,060
Please!

82
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,060
Wait!

83
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,940
Split them up?

84
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:42,730
These guys just finished fighting black beetles!

85
00:04:42,990 --> 00:04:44,700
How could they possibly fight gargoyles?

86
00:04:48,020 --> 00:04:48,639
What's wrong?

87
00:04:48,640 --> 00:04:49,350
Are you okay?

88
00:04:51,740 --> 00:04:52,370
No...

89
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,780
The poison's spread too deep.

90
00:04:54,180 --> 00:04:55,730
I never thought...

91
00:04:56,180 --> 00:04:56,710
...I'd fall here.

92
00:04:57,500 --> 00:04:57,920
Don't be afraid.

93
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,850
I won't leave you behind.

94
00:05:10,410 --> 00:05:12,110
This time, I'll be just as brave as you guys.

95
00:05:24,550 --> 00:05:25,230
Head into the tunnel.

96
00:05:25,750 --> 00:05:26,920
Forget about exploring the ruins.

97
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,050
I can only buy you three minutes.

98
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:31,170
Thanks.

99
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:31,890
Thank you.

100
00:05:34,170 --> 00:05:35,159
Foundation members,

101
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:36,110
on my command...

102
00:05:37,140 --> 00:05:37,870
strike!

103
00:05:48,130 --> 00:05:48,600
Lu Shu.

104
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,430
As for the old man,

105
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,310
I'm counting on you.

106
00:05:55,770 --> 00:05:56,930
You lured the gargoyles away

107
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:58,510
to protect the old man, right?

108
00:05:58,890 --> 00:05:59,220
Yeah.

109
00:06:00,020 --> 00:06:01,770
The old man is facing a Class A being.

110
00:06:02,310 --> 00:06:03,890
In a fight between two Class As,

111
00:06:04,430 --> 00:06:05,840
we wouldn't be able to intervene anyway.

112
00:06:06,390 --> 00:06:07,140
Even if we can't help,

113
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:09,270
we can't turn our backs on someone's kindness.

114
00:06:15,770 --> 00:06:17,850
There aren't many people in this world who truly care about us.

115
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,690
The old man can't die.

116
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,230
Xiaoyu.

117
00:06:26,770 --> 00:06:28,730
Do you think it's worth fighting for someone else?

118
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:30,639
I used to think

119
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:32,890
I'd never risk my life for anyone.

120
00:06:36,620 --> 00:06:38,170
The old man can't die.

121
00:06:44,610 --> 00:06:45,320
Wherever you go,

122
00:06:45,770 --> 00:06:46,520
I'll go with you.

123
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,210
Lu Shu, look.

124
00:07:23,630 --> 00:07:25,500
The old man doesn't need our help at all.

125
00:07:31,140 --> 00:07:31,730
Wait.

126
00:07:32,280 --> 00:07:33,059
This doesn't feel like...

127
00:07:33,060 --> 00:07:35,350
the Spiritual Pressure of just two Class A fighters.

128
00:07:46,230 --> 00:07:47,270
What's wrong, Lu Shu?

129
00:07:47,810 --> 00:07:49,410
The third Class A...

130
00:07:49,970 --> 00:07:50,700
is here.

131
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:55,660
Puppeteer!

132
00:07:59,450 --> 00:08:00,660
How could you still be alive?

133
00:08:01,780 --> 00:08:03,240
And you're teaming up with humans?

134
00:08:03,570 --> 00:08:05,810
If you can cower here and cling to life,

135
00:08:06,330 --> 00:08:08,260
why can't I be alive?

136
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:09,610
Get over here now!

137
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,460
"Teaming up with humans"?

138
00:08:12,530 --> 00:08:13,640
Does that mean...

139
00:08:14,810 --> 00:08:15,730
this guy...

140
00:08:17,180 --> 00:08:18,180
isn't human?

141
00:08:19,230 --> 00:08:20,390
"Resist the alien race,

142
00:08:20,670 --> 00:08:21,670
protect Shenzhou."

143
00:08:21,850 --> 00:08:24,070
This inhuman being I saw today...

144
00:08:24,620 --> 00:08:25,099
Perhaps...

145
00:08:25,100 --> 00:08:28,400
he's the alien race the Foundation's ancestors spoke of.

146
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:31,810
Puppeteer,

147
00:08:32,310 --> 00:08:34,200
I'm just as strong as you now.

148
00:08:34,890 --> 00:08:37,350
What makes you think I have to leave with you?

149
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:38,990
On my own,

150
00:08:39,250 --> 00:08:40,430
I can get out just fine.

151
00:08:42,290 --> 00:08:44,040
An inferior breed is always inferior.

152
00:08:45,070 --> 00:08:48,110
You seem to have forgotten our master's glory.

153
00:08:48,530 --> 00:08:50,540
Ever since I awakened...

154
00:08:51,700 --> 00:08:52,770
There are some things...

155
00:08:53,430 --> 00:08:55,350
that must never be forgotten.

156
00:08:55,980 --> 00:08:56,560
What?!

157
00:08:56,810 --> 00:08:58,260
Striking at two Class As at once?!

158
00:09:25,770 --> 00:09:27,480
Underestimating me, were you?

159
00:09:28,430 --> 00:09:29,850
Neither of you is leaving!

160
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:33,310
The Sword Pavilion rises steep and towering,

161
00:09:33,890 --> 00:09:35,230
Where one man holds the pass,

162
00:09:35,890 --> 00:09:37,730
Ten thousand cannot breach!

163
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:42,310
A successor to the Sword Pavilion still walks this world?

164
00:09:43,140 --> 00:09:44,850
To think he could turn the dust particles of this space

165
00:09:45,060 --> 00:09:46,060
all into Sword Intent!

166
00:09:46,790 --> 00:09:48,310
So this is his true power!

167
00:10:00,430 --> 00:10:02,050
To think a mongrel would be this terrified.

168
00:10:19,990 --> 00:10:20,620
Save me!

169
00:10:21,050 --> 00:10:22,589
I'll offer you my blood essence

170
00:10:22,590 --> 00:10:23,770
and serve you for eternity!

171
00:10:24,870 --> 00:10:26,130
At least you know what's good for you.

172
00:10:42,270 --> 00:10:43,830
What?

173
00:10:47,670 --> 00:10:49,630
The golden snake can swim out of the divine water?

174
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:54,450
Won't that blow my cover?

175
00:10:57,900 --> 00:10:59,840
The Sword Pavilion's successor cannot be underestimated.

176
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:01,880
The goal here is to retrieve the Blood Spirit.

177
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,340
We can't drag this out any longer.

178
00:11:09,290 --> 00:11:09,790
Mongrel!

179
00:11:10,170 --> 00:11:10,960
Get over here!

180
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:27,490
So Blood Spirit's disguise ability comes from this mask.

181
00:11:39,990 --> 00:11:40,700
Lu Shu!

182
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:43,830
What?

183
00:11:44,450 --> 00:11:46,280
How can this human suppress the mask?

184
00:11:49,310 --> 00:11:49,950
Lu Shu!

185
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:54,760
The Formation Core!

186
00:12:53,420 --> 00:12:53,989
Thank goodness!

187
00:12:53,990 --> 00:12:55,230
I'm actually still alive!

188
00:12:55,810 --> 00:12:56,420
Thank goodness!

189
00:12:56,980 --> 00:12:58,010
It's finally over!

190
00:12:58,430 --> 00:12:59,540
Quick, kill the bugs on me!

191
00:13:02,100 --> 00:13:02,680
Look over there!

192
00:13:14,270 --> 00:13:16,520
I never said I'd let you leave!

193
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:18,810
Persistent bastard!

194
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:21,830
Don't run!

195
00:13:30,060 --> 00:13:31,960
Is this what a battle between Class As looks like?

196
00:13:33,170 --> 00:13:33,500
Leader!

197
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:36,550
Lord Saint has already advanced to Class A!

198
00:13:38,010 --> 00:13:38,550
Is that so?

199
00:13:44,390 --> 00:13:45,420
The Formation Core!

200
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:46,910
My formation boundary!

201
00:13:49,690 --> 00:13:50,939
We can't linger here any longer.

202
00:13:50,940 --> 00:13:51,450
Retreat!

203
00:13:58,370 --> 00:13:58,800
Bro,

204
00:13:59,210 --> 00:13:59,690
look over there.

205
00:14:00,810 --> 00:14:02,040
Look at all those yachts!

206
00:14:03,270 --> 00:14:04,650
That's the Phoenix Society's emblem.

207
00:14:11,450 --> 00:14:11,840
Hello!

208
00:14:12,430 --> 00:14:13,510
Leader, bad news!

209
00:14:13,890 --> 00:14:14,389
Our yacht...

210
00:14:14,390 --> 00:14:15,879
some damned water-element cultivator

211
00:14:15,880 --> 00:14:16,630
just sank it!

212
00:14:17,260 --> 00:14:18,510
The other organizations' boats too!

213
00:14:51,090 --> 00:14:52,540
Life as a Rogue Cultivator really isn't easy.

214
00:14:54,050 --> 00:14:54,760
Yeah.

215
00:14:55,620 --> 00:14:57,260
Ethnic Chinese in big foreign organizations...

216
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,020
have it even worse than Rogue Cultivators.

217
00:15:02,690 --> 00:15:03,319
Want to join us?

218
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:03,710
Maybe...

219
00:15:06,340 --> 00:15:07,430
I could return to my motherland.

220
00:15:16,090 --> 00:15:17,150
The Heavenly Net is there.

221
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:30,230
This trip to the ruins was pretty great.

222
00:15:30,430 --> 00:15:32,469
Not only did I get a photo with the gargoyle boss,

223
00:15:32,470 --> 00:15:33,880
but I also totally played those organizations.

224
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,430
It felt so good!

225
00:15:38,060 --> 00:15:38,550
Though...

226
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:41,609
I was so busy messing with people

227
00:15:41,610 --> 00:15:42,680
that I didn't get to look for treasures.

228
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:45,140
Kind of a shame.

229
00:15:45,385 --> 00:15:46,403
Heh.

230
00:15:46,490 --> 00:15:49,050
So you just went into the ruins to let loose?

231
00:15:49,940 --> 00:15:52,219
What happened to figuring out ways to make money,

232
00:15:52,220 --> 00:15:53,590
and grabbing the Formation Core?

233
00:15:54,790 --> 00:15:55,470
Speaking of which...

234
00:15:55,930 --> 00:15:57,710
Quite a few people saw me take the Formation Core.

235
00:15:58,340 --> 00:15:59,839
Xiaoyu and the old man

236
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:00,970
are willing to cover for me,

237
00:16:01,380 --> 00:16:03,380
but the Puppeteer and his crew might leak it.

238
00:16:04,260 --> 00:16:05,469
Instead of hiding it now

239
00:16:05,470 --> 00:16:06,380
and giving people ammo against me later,

240
00:16:06,970 --> 00:16:08,680
I might as well report it myself.

241
00:16:09,300 --> 00:16:11,470
It'll also let me see where Nie Ting stands.

242
00:16:12,990 --> 00:16:14,250
About the ruins...

243
00:16:14,460 --> 00:16:14,840
Hold on a second.

244
00:16:15,170 --> 00:16:15,800
Come here.

245
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:18,430
When you report back to Nie Ting,

246
00:16:18,550 --> 00:16:20,510
don't say we never even saw the Formation Core.

247
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:22,880
And don't tell him what I did in the ruins.

248
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:26,329
Just say we gave it our best shot,

249
00:16:26,330 --> 00:16:27,450
but suffered a narrow defeat.

250
00:16:28,260 --> 00:16:29,320
How's the phrase "narrow defeat"?

251
00:16:29,410 --> 00:16:30,450
I picked it up from the movies.

252
00:16:32,870 --> 00:16:33,520
Think about it.

253
00:16:33,790 --> 00:16:35,410
We can't really be blamed for this.

254
00:16:35,710 --> 00:16:37,049
Two Class As going at it—

255
00:16:37,050 --> 00:16:38,740
how could we possibly get involved?

256
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:39,330
Right?

257
00:16:40,060 --> 00:16:42,100
It's totally normal that we didn't get it.

258
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:44,910
Xiaoyu, don't you agree?

259
00:16:46,890 --> 00:16:47,850
The Formation Core is right here with me.

260
00:16:50,250 --> 00:16:50,539
Th-This...

261
00:16:50,540 --> 00:16:51,420
Is this for real?

262
00:16:54,010 --> 00:16:54,620
This is it.

263
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,430
This thing...

264
00:16:57,570 --> 00:16:58,770
really is the Formation Core?

265
00:17:06,540 --> 00:17:07,830
What the heck?!

266
00:17:08,250 --> 00:17:10,810
This thing actually attacks humans on its own?!

267
00:17:11,700 --> 00:17:13,380
Get back in there!

268
00:17:16,990 --> 00:17:17,450
Bro...

269
00:17:18,080 --> 00:17:19,080
What's the deal with this thing?

270
00:17:19,350 --> 00:17:20,320
Why does it bite people?!

271
00:17:22,150 --> 00:17:23,060
This is the Formation Core.

272
00:17:24,020 --> 00:17:25,230
It seems to grant disguise abilities.

273
00:17:25,380 --> 00:17:27,350
Aside from that, I'm not too sure yet.

274
00:17:28,290 --> 00:17:29,500
Don't mess with me, bro.

275
00:17:30,420 --> 00:17:31,000
I gotta ask:

276
00:17:31,450 --> 00:17:32,829
Do you know something

277
00:17:32,830 --> 00:17:34,130
that I don't?

278
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:37,960
I can't tell him only I can suppress this mask.

279
00:17:38,390 --> 00:17:39,470
We're on the same side.

280
00:17:40,010 --> 00:17:41,650
Don't hold out on me.

281
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:45,220
You said you want to know something you don't know,

282
00:17:45,580 --> 00:17:46,010
right?

283
00:17:46,810 --> 00:17:48,480
Yeah! Just spit it out!

284
00:17:49,020 --> 00:17:50,480
Don't you trust me?

285
00:17:51,810 --> 00:17:52,640
What a coincidence.

286
00:17:53,220 --> 00:17:54,640
I really do have something to tell you.

287
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:56,520
Out with it, quick!

288
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:59,890
The old man's been searching the ruins for you for two days.

289
00:18:00,090 --> 00:18:00,889
Once he gets back,

290
00:18:00,890 --> 00:18:02,930
the first thing he does will probably be—

291
00:18:05,470 --> 00:18:06,019
No time to lose!

292
00:18:06,020 --> 00:18:07,810
I... I'm heading back home right now!

293
00:18:08,270 --> 00:18:08,929
Book the flight!

294
00:18:08,930 --> 00:18:09,890
Hurry, hurry, hurry, hurry!

295
00:18:13,770 --> 00:18:17,770
Looks like it attacks all humans completely on its own.

296
00:18:18,870 --> 00:18:21,010
If the flame in my heart hadn't kept it in check,

297
00:18:21,390 --> 00:18:22,680
I probably would've fallen victim to it.

298
00:18:23,850 --> 00:18:24,430
Xiaoyu.

299
00:18:25,180 --> 00:18:26,060
Tell me,

300
00:18:26,310 --> 00:18:27,280
that flame...

301
00:18:27,810 --> 00:18:28,930
what on earth is it anyway?

302
00:18:30,600 --> 00:18:31,140
Xiaoyu?

303
00:18:32,620 --> 00:18:34,410
Figure these things out yourself.

304
00:18:34,940 --> 00:18:36,480
Don't interrupt me watching The Outcast.

305
00:18:38,890 --> 00:18:41,680
Then why, when the Puppeteer got the mask,

306
00:18:41,850 --> 00:18:43,140
didn't he close the ruins?

307
00:18:45,350 --> 00:18:48,010
Do you think Zhang Chulan really has the Origin of Qi?

308
00:18:49,770 --> 00:18:51,060
I guess so...

309
00:18:52,430 --> 00:18:53,020
Wait, no.

310
00:18:53,420 --> 00:18:54,600
Why am I letting you sidetrack me?

311
00:19:05,770 --> 00:19:08,330
Today was way too much information to process.

312
00:19:09,100 --> 00:19:10,770
A mask that attacks people on its own...

313
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:13,060
was actually subdued by the flame in my heart.

314
00:19:13,580 --> 00:19:14,320
Why is that?

315
00:19:15,810 --> 00:19:16,600
Come to think of it...

316
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:18,419
in a normal person's heart,

317
00:19:18,420 --> 00:19:20,420
would there really be an ever-burning flame?

318
00:19:21,770 --> 00:19:23,870
Then there's the sapling growing in my palm,

319
00:19:25,100 --> 00:19:25,880
and the Astral Map system.

320
00:19:28,100 --> 00:19:29,350
I never really thought about it before,

321
00:19:30,120 --> 00:19:31,960
but why do I have so many anomalies?

322
00:19:33,170 --> 00:19:33,670
Could it be...

323
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:35,960
that I'm not actually human?

324
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:39,020
How could that even be possible?

325
00:19:41,850 --> 00:19:43,940
Why did the Puppeteer just hand me the Formation Core?

326
00:19:45,060 --> 00:19:47,069
Maybe the Formation Core is really just a key...

327
00:19:47,070 --> 00:19:48,970
to enter and exit the ruins at will.

328
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:50,750
And this key...

329
00:19:51,100 --> 00:19:52,270
can only be used by humans.

330
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:55,529
He used my contact with the mask as a trigger

331
00:19:55,530 --> 00:19:56,560
to escape the ruins,

332
00:19:56,980 --> 00:19:58,930
and used the mask to kill me in the process.

333
00:20:00,600 --> 00:20:02,560
Too bad he probably never expected...

334
00:20:03,140 --> 00:20:05,480
that I'd actually claim the mask for myself.

335
00:20:13,140 --> 00:20:14,970
Since it's already mine,

336
00:20:15,320 --> 00:20:16,090
how about...

337
00:20:16,390 --> 00:20:17,890
I try putting it on?

338
00:20:22,220 --> 00:20:24,310
I knew it wouldn't be that easy.

339
00:20:27,670 --> 00:20:29,910
The flame suppressed the mask again.

340
00:20:33,180 --> 00:20:35,160
W-Why does it have this expression?

341
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:37,480
Whatever, forget it.

342
00:20:37,640 --> 00:20:38,980
Let's try transforming into someone first.

343
00:20:39,810 --> 00:20:41,770
Let's go with Li Yixiao.

344
00:20:47,590 --> 00:20:48,510
What the heck?

345
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:50,140
Isn't this body still mine?

346
00:20:50,840 --> 00:20:52,340
Why did only the face change and not the body?

347
00:20:52,550 --> 00:20:53,839
Did you ancient Artifact Refiners

348
00:20:53,840 --> 00:20:55,590
really design products like this?

349
00:20:59,210 --> 00:21:00,290
Sigh, whatever.

350
00:21:01,120 --> 00:21:02,220
Though this thing is pretty half-baked,

351
00:21:02,960 --> 00:21:04,330
at least it can be used as a disguise.

352
00:21:05,210 --> 00:21:07,030
I drew way too much attention in the ruins this time.

353
00:21:09,650 --> 00:21:11,499
Plus, Li Yixiao even shouted my name

354
00:21:11,500 --> 00:21:12,540
right in front of everyone.

355
00:21:14,090 --> 00:21:16,380
Looks like I'll have to watch my back from now on.

356
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:27,310
This overseas trip was definitely worth it.

357
00:21:27,990 --> 00:21:28,450
Still,

358
00:21:28,710 --> 00:21:31,290
overall, the harvest from the ruins was huge.

359
00:21:32,850 --> 00:21:33,920
The divine water grew a lot,

360
00:21:35,150 --> 00:21:36,810
the Astral Map advanced a tier,

361
00:21:40,530 --> 00:21:41,720
I acquired an Artifact Spirit,

362
00:21:43,040 --> 00:21:44,770
and I even got the Formation Core.

363
00:21:45,690 --> 00:21:47,150
And lastly...

364
00:21:56,710 --> 00:21:57,500
Goodbye.

365
00:21:59,950 --> 00:22:01,760
Who're you saying goodbye to?

366
00:22:02,910 --> 00:22:03,900
Nobody, nobody!

367
00:22:05,560 --> 00:22:06,290
Lu Shu,

368
00:22:06,910 --> 00:22:07,630
you've changed.

369
00:22:23,320 --> 00:22:24,460
Time to head home!

370
00:22:34,580 --> 00:22:36,269
Pardon me, better watch out,

371
00:22:36,270 --> 00:22:38,200
make way for this mouth of mine.

372
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:40,709
If you get caught in the crossfire,

373
00:22:40,710 --> 00:22:42,650
that was my exact intention.

374
00:22:42,940 --> 00:22:43,900
Say no.

375
00:22:45,030 --> 00:22:46,580
Say no.

376
00:22:47,380 --> 00:22:48,830
Say no.

377
00:22:49,600 --> 00:22:51,110
Say no.

378
00:22:52,370 --> 00:22:53,919
Endless lectures in various guises,

379
00:22:53,920 --> 00:22:55,950
all reek of the same old crap.

380
00:22:56,750 --> 00:22:58,509
You'd better drop out early;

381
00:22:58,510 --> 00:23:00,860
low odds are all that saved you.

382
00:23:01,290 --> 00:23:02,839
If someone's willing to take the hit,

383
00:23:02,840 --> 00:23:04,600
I'll throw in buy five, get one free.

384
00:23:05,670 --> 00:23:06,409
Just don't—

385
00:23:06,410 --> 00:23:07,250
whatever you do, don't

386
00:23:07,380 --> 00:23:09,780
bottle up all that resentment.

387
00:23:10,710 --> 00:23:13,910
Do you really feel so wronged?

388
00:23:15,090 --> 00:23:19,890
Tell me so I can get a good laugh.

389
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:25,630
Being great isn't that unique.

390
00:23:25,720 --> 00:23:30,040
Savior of the world or just an ant—

391
00:23:30,320 --> 00:23:32,290
why cage yourself in?

392
00:23:32,380 --> 00:23:38,999
Since when is suffering for nothing a victory?

393
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:43,469
Good or bad, someone will bash you anyway.

394
00:23:43,470 --> 00:23:47,080
Understand me or not, suit yourself.

395
00:23:48,080 --> 00:23:50,070
Just call it a rebellious phase

396
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:56,750
that's lasting my whole life.

